# Git branch lifecycle aligned with reviewed branch-retention policy.
LIFECYCLE git-branch VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Ticket branch from creation through reviewed merge or explicit archival"
STATE ABSENT INITIAL
STATE ACTIVE
STATE REVIEW
STATE CLOSED_UNMERGED
STATE MERGED
STATE ARCHIVED
STATE DELETED TERMINAL
EVENT CREATE
EVENT PUSH
EVENT OPEN_PR
EVENT MERGE_PR
EVENT CLOSE_PR
EVENT REOPEN_PR
EVENT ARCHIVE
EVENT DELETE
EVIDENCE TRUSTED_CURRENT_HEAD_APPROVAL
EVIDENCE OWNER_DISCARD_DECISION
EVIDENCE MERGED_HEAD_OBSERVED
TRANSITION ABSENT -> ACTIVE ON CREATE
TRANSITION ACTIVE -> ACTIVE ON PUSH
TRANSITION ACTIVE -> REVIEW ON OPEN_PR
TRANSITION REVIEW -> REVIEW ON PUSH
TRANSITION REVIEW -> MERGED ON MERGE_PR REQUIRES TRUSTED_CURRENT_HEAD_APPROVAL
TRANSITION REVIEW -> CLOSED_UNMERGED ON CLOSE_PR
TRANSITION CLOSED_UNMERGED -> REVIEW ON REOPEN_PR
TRANSITION CLOSED_UNMERGED -> ARCHIVED ON ARCHIVE REQUIRES OWNER_DISCARD_DECISION
TRANSITION MERGED -> DELETED ON DELETE REQUIRES MERGED_HEAD_OBSERVED
TRANSITION ARCHIVED -> DELETED ON DELETE REQUIRES OWNER_DISCARD_DECISION
REJECT ACTIVE ON DELETE WITH GIT-BRANCH-001
REJECT REVIEW ON DELETE WITH GIT-BRANCH-002
REJECT CLOSED_UNMERGED ON DELETE WITH GIT-BRANCH-003
ERROR GIT-BRANCH-001 SEVERITY ERROR MESSAGE "Unmerged branch requires integration or an explicit owner discard decision."
ERROR GIT-BRANCH-002 SEVERITY ERROR MESSAGE "Branch with an open pull request cannot be deleted."
ERROR GIT-BRANCH-003 SEVERITY ERROR MESSAGE "Pull request closed without merge preserves its branch until owner-authorized archival."
END

# Generic governed work-ticket lifecycle proving a second independent domain.
LIFECYCLE governed-ticket VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Governed work ticket from draft through evidence-backed completion or cancellation"
STATE DRAFT INITIAL
STATE PLAN
STATE IN_PROGRESS
STATE BLOCKED
STATE DONE TERMINAL
STATE CANCELLED TERMINAL
EVENT PLAN_WORK
EVENT START
EVENT BLOCK
EVENT RESUME
EVENT COMPLETE
EVENT CANCEL
EVIDENCE SESSION_EXECUTION_AUTHORIZATION
EVIDENCE BLOCKER_RESOLUTION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE ACCEPTANCE_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE OWNER_DECISION
TRANSITION DRAFT -> PLAN ON PLAN_WORK
TRANSITION PLAN -> IN_PROGRESS ON START REQUIRES SESSION_EXECUTION_AUTHORIZATION
TRANSITION IN_PROGRESS -> BLOCKED ON BLOCK
TRANSITION BLOCKED -> IN_PROGRESS ON RESUME REQUIRES BLOCKER_RESOLUTION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION IN_PROGRESS -> DONE ON COMPLETE REQUIRES ACCEPTANCE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION DRAFT -> CANCELLED ON CANCEL REQUIRES OWNER_DECISION
TRANSITION PLAN -> CANCELLED ON CANCEL REQUIRES OWNER_DECISION
TRANSITION IN_PROGRESS -> CANCELLED ON CANCEL REQUIRES OWNER_DECISION
TRANSITION BLOCKED -> CANCELLED ON CANCEL REQUIRES OWNER_DECISION
REJECT DRAFT ON COMPLETE WITH TICKET-LIFECYCLE-001
REJECT PLAN ON COMPLETE WITH TICKET-LIFECYCLE-002
REJECT BLOCKED ON COMPLETE WITH TICKET-LIFECYCLE-003
ERROR TICKET-LIFECYCLE-001 SEVERITY ERROR MESSAGE "Draft ticket cannot complete before planning and execution."
ERROR TICKET-LIFECYCLE-002 SEVERITY ERROR MESSAGE "Planned ticket cannot complete before authorized execution."
ERROR TICKET-LIFECYCLE-003 SEVERITY ERROR MESSAGE "Blocked ticket cannot complete before blocker resolution."
END
